  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">NDI - Elections Cap Build</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">National Democratic Institute- Elections Cap Build - Evaluation and monitoring</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Projektet &#xe4;mnar &#xe5;tg&#xe4;rda de problem som inhemska och internationella   observat&#xf6;rer lyft som r&#xf6;r valprocessen. Detta projekt inneb&#xe4;r         forskning om allm&#xe4;nhetens f&#xf6;rtroende f&#xf6;r och inst&#xe4;llning till         valprocessen, st&#xe4;rka kapaciteten f&#xf6;r analys och kartl&#xe4;ggning av       valresultat, utbildning av parterna valobservat&#xf6;rer och CEC           valf&#xf6;rr&#xe4;ttare, etc.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project will address concerns raised by domestic and              international observers concerning the electoral process. This        project entails research on public confidence in, and attitudes       towards the electoral process, strenghtening the capacity for         analysis and mapping of election results, training of parties         election observers and CEC election officials, etc.</narrative>
  </description>
